  "body_html": "<h1>tendsto_diam_to_zero</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem tendsto_diam_to_zero (f : stdSimplex ℝ (Fin n) → stdSimplex ℝ (Fin n)) : Tendsto (fun k =&gt; Metric.diam ((((room_seq f (g1 f ((hpkg f).1.2 k))).1.1.image (fun x =&gt; TTtostdSimplex x)) : Set (stdSimplex ℝ (Fin n))))) atTop (𝓝 0)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>room_seq</li>\n<li>TTtostdSimplex</li>\n<li>isDominant</li>\n<li>TT</li>\n<li>size_bound_in</li>\n</ul>",
